WEBVTT

00:00:03.350 --> 00:00:07.600 line:0 align:center
Welcome to Dash, the dashboard editor in MOTO-HUB Studio.

00:00:09.400 --> 00:00:15.900 line:0 align:center
On the left are the settings, starting with Theme. On the right is a live preview of the dash you're working on.

00:00:16.250 --> 00:00:20.325 line:0 align:center
Below the preview, My dashes lists every dash you've saved.

00:00:20.700 --> 00:00:27.850 line:0 align:center
To save, keep the same name to overwrite the dash, or type a new name to keep a separate copy. Then click Save.

00:00:28.200 --> 00:00:33.875 line:0 align:center
Send to phone sends the dash you're editing straight to your phone, over Wi-Fi or USB.

00:00:37.450 --> 00:00:40.025 line:0 align:center
To connect a phone, open Phone.

00:00:40.350 --> 00:00:46.000 line:0 align:center
You pair it once, and from then on everything is automatic. You don't need to type anything.

00:00:49.000 --> 00:00:51.175 line:0 align:center
After that, you just connect.

00:00:51.725 --> 00:00:56.475 line:0 align:center
Once connected, every change you send appears on your phone in real time.

00:00:58.175 --> 00:01:02.000 line:0 align:center
So you see the real thing on your phone, without the simulator.

00:01:02.675 --> 00:01:06.675 line:0 align:center
Don't like it? Change it, send it again, and it updates live.
